From de40b04d8104010a4d79b89ad69e9110c576bb03 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eray <erayaker784@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:17:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign landing page with animated hero and easier
 onboarding

- Live in-engine hero animation (canvas) using the game's own sprites,
  battlefield map and explosion spritesheet
- Download CTA always points to the latest release (Eagle-1-Windows.zip)
- Sections: gameplay, mission modes, strike arsenal, squad vs. Automatons
- Three-step Windows install guide incl. SmartScreen hint, controls,
  run-from-source instructions for macOS/Linux
- Optimized image assets (WebP), respects prefers-reduced-motion,
  responsive down to phone width
- Fan-project disclaimer in footer

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014kWrkfC6oLee9pcn4GgU3n
